Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Title,,0,0,0,,PosFlow | Cash operations that stay balanced
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Role-based access separates cashier, supervisor,\Nadministrator and finance duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:23.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The cashier opens a till with a declared starting balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:41.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A fast POS records products, cash payments\Nand the live expected drawer balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:01:07.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Remittances track money sent and received\Nwithout mixing it with drawer cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:17.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Authorized employee advances are issued\Nfrom the correct branch and till.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:28.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Finance gets a consolidated view of cash, custody,\Nremittances and outstanding advances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:44.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Finance authorizes advances and records\Nreceipts, returns and supporting evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every movement remains traceable by user and role.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:02:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Supervisors prepare, fill and seal cash bundles\Nbefore moving them into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Roles can switch while each permission remains enforced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:35.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,A blind cash count compares expected and actual cash\Nwithout revealing the target beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:43.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Closing differences are routed for supervisor review.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:49.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The exception closes with an explanation\Nand a complete audit trail.
